Python runtime dependencies
  The images in components/ install the pinned packages listed in each component's
  requirements.lock from PyPI at build time. Those packages stay under their own
  licences, which are not redistributed in this repository; the lock records the exact
  version and sha256 of every artifact that enters an image.

CrowdSec (optional integration; nothing bundled)
  This repository ships no CrowdSec source text, no copied documentation and no
  build of it. It ships a pinned manifest that pulls the upstream image by digest
  (components/control/crowdsec/versions.json) and adapters that speak the Local
  API over HTTP. Consult the upstream project for its license and distribution terms.

